flowchart TD
  B[Browser bag] --> Q[POST checkout quote]
  Q --> V[Validate IDs, quantities, customer input]
  V --> P[Read current D1 prices, stock, offers, delivery]
  P --> T[Server-calculated totals]
  T --> O[Persist order + items + idempotency key]
  O --> PA[Payment/COD attempt]
  PA -->|confirmed| C[Order confirmed]
  PA -->|pending| PP[Pending payment]
  PA -->|ambiguous| U[Payment unknown]
  U --> R[Reconciliation]
  C --> PR[Processing]
  PR --> S[Shipped via courier adapter]
  S --> D[Delivered]
  D --> RR[Return requested]
  RR --> RT[Returned/approved]
  RT --> RF[Refunded through authorized flow]
  PA -->|failed| F[Failed/cancelled]
  classDef browser fill:#fff9f6,stroke:#d77fd9,color:#2f2130,stroke-width:2px
  classDef core fill:#fbe8f1,stroke:#9a3b9f,color:#2f2130,stroke-width:2px
  class B browser
  class Q,V,P,T,O,PA,C,PP,U,R,PR,S,D,RR,RT,RF,F core
